OL,3,GNEWSAMagical sleuths battled with law
OL,4,Aover witch claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo-called service magicians, also known
OL,7,Fas "cunning folk", would earn their
OL,8,Fmoney by using "good magic" to carry
OL,9,Fout tasks such as solving a crime or
OL,10,Ffinding lost items.
